{'symbol': 'BIIB', 'date': '2022-02-17 09:30:00', 'title': 'BIIB LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES BIOGEN INC. INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK, FEB. 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN BIOGEN INC. ("BIOGEN" OR THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: BIIB) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT. CLASS DEFINITION: THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES ON BEHALF OF BIOGEN INVESTORS WHO WERE ADVERSELY AFFECTED BY ALLEGED SECURITIES FRAUD BETWEEN JUNE 7, 2021 AND JANUARY 11, 2022.'}